# DHA copy rule

When writing or revising dental marketing copy for Dubai/UAE Framer templates:

- No guaranteed clinical outcomes or superiority claims
- Include MOHAP advertisement licence and DHA facility licence placeholder slots in footers
- Use consultation / assessment CTAs
- Case and testimonial UI must surface consent + outcomes-vary notes
- Prefer verifiable, buyer-editable stats over invented KPIs
